WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
(engine revving)

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.666
(carnival music)

00:00:01.666 --> 00:00:04.480
- The first ride is
the straight-wall ride.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.539
The second act is our go-kart.

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:09.380
So it's four wheels this time.

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.618
Third act, it's riding one
of these lovely ladies.

00:00:12.618 --> 00:00:15.507
And we do hands-off,
standing up hands-off,

00:00:15.507 --> 00:00:17.688
sitting on the side, standing on the side,

00:00:17.688 --> 00:00:19.521
a whole array of acts.

00:00:20.865 --> 00:00:23.299
It's an experience you can't compare

00:00:23.299 --> 00:00:25.466
anything in the world to.

00:00:28.715 --> 00:00:31.435
I'm Kerri Cameron and
I'm a Wall of Death rider

00:00:31.435 --> 00:00:34.955
and I ride for Luke Fox's
original Wall of Death.

00:00:34.955 --> 00:00:37.589
- See the Hell Riders race this afternoon.

00:00:37.589 --> 00:00:39.099
We'll take you way back in time.

00:00:39.099 --> 00:00:40.568
Back to the late 1920’s ...

00:00:40.568 --> 00:00:44.209
- I started riding the Wall
of Death by pure accident.

00:00:44.209 --> 00:00:45.939
(somber music)

00:00:45.939 --> 00:00:47.837
I used to work with horses ...

00:00:47.837 --> 00:00:50.841
And unfortunately, where I was
working the place shut down.

00:00:50.841 --> 00:00:53.918
So naturally, we went to the job center

00:00:53.918 --> 00:00:57.267
and I just typed in horse
rider into the search engine

00:00:57.267 --> 00:00:59.256
and Wall of Death rider came up.

00:00:59.256 --> 00:01:03.387
And I went down to the yard
and they had the wall built up.

00:01:03.387 --> 00:01:06.220
I knew there and then that was it.

00:01:08.172 --> 00:01:11.172
(suspenseful music)

00:01:14.526 --> 00:01:16.896
You do get very dizzy when
you first learn to ride

00:01:16.896 --> 00:01:17.976
because you've got to
build your stamina up

00:01:17.976 --> 00:01:19.393
to the dizziness.

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:22.250
(child screams in delight)

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.041
You have to be going at least
30 mile an hour to stay on

00:01:24.041 --> 00:01:27.142
otherwise gravity will
just whip you straight off.

00:01:27.142 --> 00:01:28.822
It’s a mixture of three things,

00:01:28.822 --> 00:01:32.989
so balance, speed and
obviously a bit of stamina.

00:01:34.399 --> 00:01:36.761
Just lifting your arm up to wave goodbye

00:01:36.761 --> 00:01:39.771
to the audience is quite a feat.

00:01:39.771 --> 00:01:41.233
- Ladies and gentlemen ...

00:01:41.233 --> 00:01:42.262
Kerri Cameron.

00:01:42.262 --> 00:01:44.278
(cheers)

00:01:44.278 --> 00:01:45.111
(carnival music)

00:01:45.111 --> 00:01:46.939
- It is a good feeling
being a female rider

00:01:46.939 --> 00:01:49.439
in this masculine environment.

00:01:50.407 --> 00:01:52.729
It gives me a great buzz
because a lot of people,

00:01:52.729 --> 00:01:54.289
when they see you walk into the wall,

00:01:54.289 --> 00:01:56.510
they just think you're a
bit of flash, you know.

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:58.310
But as soon as they see
you get on the bike,

00:01:58.310 --> 00:01:59.659
you can hear like murmurs saying

00:01:59.659 --> 00:02:03.120
"Oh, there's a girl on a motorbike."

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:05.537
See all their faces light up.

00:02:08.009 --> 00:02:11.921
And then after the show, all
the girls they're all like wow,

00:02:11.921 --> 00:02:13.369
you've got bigger balls
than most of the men.

00:02:13.369 --> 00:02:15.001
(laughs)

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:18.059
But it's great to know that
they're looking at you thinking

00:02:18.059 --> 00:02:21.142
well if you can do it, then so can I.

